Jackass: The Movie is a action, comedy,
documentary film directed by Jeff Tremaine.

3
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:51,000
Johnny Knoxville and his band of maniacs perform a variety of stunts
and gross-out gags on the big screen for the first time.

4
