11
00:46:45,000 --> 00:46:51,000
Jackass: The Movie is a 2002 American reality slapstick
comedy film directed by Jeff Tremaine.

12
00:51:00,000 --> 00:51:06,000
It is a continuation of the MTV television series
Jackass, which had completed its run.

13
00:55:15,000 --> 00:55:21,000
It was produced by Lynch Siderow Productions and Dickhouse Productions.

14
00:59:30,000 --> 00:59:36,000
The film features most of the original Jackass cast, including leader Johnny Knoxville, Bam Margera, Chris
Pontius, Steve-O, Dave England, Ryan Dunn, Jason "Wee Man" Acuña, Preston Lacy and Ehren McGhehey.

15
01:03:45,000 --> 01:03:51,000
MTV Films and Paramount Pictures released the film
to theaters on October 25, 2002.

16
01:08:00,000 --> 01:08:06,000
It grossed over $79 million worldwide and received mixed reviews from critics.

17
01:12:15,000 --> 01:12:21,000
It was followed by a sequel, Jackass Number Two (2006).

18
01:16:30,000 --> 01:16:36,000
The film explores themes of pain, idiot, disgust, stunt, music video.

19
01:20:45,000 --> 01:20:51,000
The tone is lighthearted.
